<event start="TLI_21" end="TLI_22">(0.48) </event>
<event start="TLI_22" end="TLI_23">Aber das- </event>
<event start="TLI_23" end="TLI_24">da kannte man ja- </event>
<event start="TLI_24" end="TLI_25">(0.21) </event>
<event start="TLI_25" end="TLI_26">da kam das Düngerstreuen eben so an. </event>
<event start="TLI_26" end="TLI_27">(0.58) </event>
<event start="TLI_27" end="TLI_28">Das erste was wir streuten, </event>
<event start="TLI_28" end="TLI_29">(0.34) </event>
